graph TD
    subgraph Frontend [Frontend (Next.js)]
        A1[React UI] --> A2[Zod + React Hook Form]
        A2 --> A3[TanStack Query]
    end

    subgraph Auth [Authentication]
        A3 -- Login/Register --> B1[JWT Auth Flow]
        A3 -- SSO --> B2[Azure AD SSO]
    end

    subgraph Backend [Backend (NestJS)]
        B1 --> C1[Controllers]
        B2 --> C1
        C1 --> C2[Services & RBAC]
        C2 --> C3[Prisma ORM]
    end

    subgraph Database [Database]
        C3 --> D1[(PostgreSQL)]
    end

    subgraph Hosting [Cost Optimised Hosting]
        H1[Vercel - Frontend]
        H2[Railway / Render - Backend]
        H3[Supabase / Neon - PostgreSQL]
    end

    Frontend -. Deployed to .-> H1
    Backend -. Deployed to .-> H2
    Database -. Hosted on .-> H3
